RichUpgradeTest seeds synthetic 2.x data inside the exact public 2.2.1 APK (raw SQL on schema 11 and
preference files only, so the new test APK runs inside the old app), snapshots it, and after
install -r of the candidate requires every user table, the seeded preferences and the running
timer to be identical. Added to the signed RC workflow as a separate fresh emulator.
No application code is changed.

